  "description": "Del Sol’s LXi bikes move you in comfort and style. Our lightweight aluminum V-Gusset frame is strong and handsome, and with six available sizes, it ensures a comfortable fit, like a good pair of shoes. Adjustable-rise stems, cushy saddles and suspension seatposts provide oodles of comfort, while easy-shifting gears keep you rolling smoothly uphill and down. Everything about an LXi, from the stable handling to the puncture-resistant belted tires, is designed to let you ride without worry, so you can focus on other things...or not. Exercise never felt this easy. Or this fun.",
